WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.400
Four discovery picks.
One comparative first choice.

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:07.400
In RecoScope’s November 22
robot vacuum snapshot,

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:11.150
all four comparisons ranked
Roborock first and Dreame second.

00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:14.800
But the open recommendations led
with four different brands.

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:17.100
ChatGPT chose Dreame.

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:18.900
Claude leaned toward Shark.

00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:20.800
Gemini recommended Roborock.

00:00:20.860 --> 00:00:22.800
And Perplexity led with MOVA.

00:00:23.020 --> 00:00:25.300
We captured 12 usable answers

00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:28.000
across four AI assistants
and three prompt types,

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:31.400
using the same two-story household
with a long-haired cat.

00:00:31.620 --> 00:00:34.600
Roborock appeared in
11 of 12 answers,

00:00:34.640 --> 00:00:37.100
and all four
under-$500 answers.

00:00:37.360 --> 00:00:40.000
A mention does not verify
a qualifying price.

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:44.800
On November 16, Roborock also ranked
first in all four comparisons.

00:00:44.920 --> 00:00:46.800
These are two dated captures,

00:00:46.960 --> 00:00:49.600
not a controlled trend
or proof of product quality.

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:53.300
For your brand, compare visibility,
explicit rankings,

00:00:53.440 --> 00:00:55.000
and the recommendation context.

00:00:55.100 --> 00:00:57.967
Explore benchmark at
getrecoscope.com.
